.TH GREDIST 1 "2026-09-05" "Saphira Linux" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
gredist \- Protocol 47/GRE distributor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gredist
[\fB--syslog\fR] \fIservice_name\fR
.br
.B gredist
.B -c
\fIconfig_path\fR [\fB--syslog\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B saphira-gredist
is a small userspace control service that distributes raw Protocol 47/GRE traffic from a single frontend address to a pool of backends. Userspace owns configuration, membership, health and HRW distribution; kernel handles high-rate packet I/O via raw sockets and optional nft fast-path.
.PP
Each service is named by its config file:
.B /etc/saphira/gredist/\fIservice_name\fR.conf
and started as
.B gredist \fIservice_name\fR.
.PP
Config is deliberately simple: one
.B frontend=IP
and one or more
.B backend=IP
lines. IPv4 and IPv6 use same syntax; mixed pools and cross-family forwarding (v4->v6, v6->v4) are supported by rebuilding the outer IP envelope while preserving GRE header and inner payload.
.SH CONFIGURATION
.nf
frontend=217.155.241.55
backend=172.16.10.10
backend=172.16.10.11

frontend=2a02:8012:bc57::47
backend=2a02:8012:bc57:100::10
.fi
.PP
Comments start with \fB#\fR or \fB;\fR. Exactly one frontend, at least one backend. Families are not tied.
.SH GRE HANDLING
Parsing follows Linux \fBnet/ipv4/gre_demux.c:gre_parse_header\fR: validate outer IP, check \fBGRE_VERSION\fR and \fBGRE_ROUTING\fR, compute \fBgre_calc_hlen\fR from CSUM/KEY/SEQ, fail closed on truncated or malformed, support keyless and keyed (key is visible tunnel identifier). Fragments, oversized (>9000) and queue pressure are counted as drops.
.SH DISTRIBUTION
Rendezvous/HRW hashing on outer source address plus GRE key when present. Score = splitmix64(fnv1a(backend) XOR flow_hash). Removal moves only affected flows; rejoin is deterministic.
.SH HEALTH
ICMP ping per backend every 2s; 2 consecutive fails -> down, 2 successes -> up. Logs transitions. No healthy backend -> drop.
.SH SIGNALS
.B SIGHUP
reload config,
.B SIGUSR1
dump stats,
.B SIGINT/SIGTERM
exit.
.SH FILES
.B /etc/saphira/gredist/*.conf
.br
.B /run/saphira/gredist/
.SH SEE ALSO
.B ip-gre(8), nft(8)
